%h5= title
%p.help-text
  Per month of each membership's active time in range. Each payment is spread evenly across the
  billing period it pays for, and only the part inside the range counts. Redeemed is the ticket
  value its holder redeemed in range; net is revenue less redeemed. A membership active for less
  than a month counts as one month.
.table-scroll
  %table.hover
    %thead
      %tr
        %th Offer
        %th Memberships
        - ['Revenue / month', 'Redeemed / month', 'Net / month'].each do |figure|
          %th Avg #{figure.downcase}
          %th Min #{figure.downcase}
          %th Max #{figure.downcase}
    %tbody
      - rows.each do |stats|
        - figures = stats.public_send(economics)
        %tr{ class: total_row_class(stats) }
          %td= membership_offer_cell(stats.offer)
          %td= figures.membership_count
          - [figures.revenue, figures.redeemed, figures.net].each do |spread|
            %td= membership_money(spread.avg)
            %td= membership_extreme(spread.minimum, spread.minimum_membership)
            %td= membership_extreme(spread.maximum, spread.maximum_membership)
